---
kind: scene
id: spine.elite.frostine
title: The Elite Four — Frostine
on: challenge
target: arena.frostChamber
once: false
when: "@badgeCount >= 8 && !holds(defeated(frostine))"
---

## The chamber

::bg{location="frostChamber" time="day"}
::auto{character="frostine" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@frostine: Welcome to the Summit League. I am Frostine of the Elite Four. Nobody has ever warmed this room, and nobody will.
::music{action="change" mood="battle" volume="up"}
::battle{foe="frostine" kind="elite" resultKey="fight"}
<match on="scene.battle.fight.won">
  <when is="true">
    @frostine: Hm. You are colder than you look. Go on.
    ::assert{defeated(frostine)}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @frostine: Frozen solid. Come back when you have thawed.
    // the streak breaks: the whole Four must be beaten again
    ::retract{defeated(frostine)}
    ::retract{defeated(tarrok)}
    ::retract{defeated(morwen)}
    ::retract{defeated(drakon)}
  </otherwise>
</match>
